<p align="left"> <strong>CH&Iacute;NH S&Aacute;CH B&#7842;O M&#7852;T</strong></p>
<p align="left">Ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch  b&#7843;o m&#7853;t cho b&#7841;n bi&#7871;t ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s&#7917; d&#7909;ng th&ocirc;ng tin c&aacute;  nh&acirc;n c&#7911;a b&#7841;n thu th&#7853;p &#273;&#432;&#7907;c t&#7841;i trang web n&agrave;y nh&#432; th&#7871;  n&agrave;o. Xin vui l&ograve;ng &#273;&#7885;c ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch b&#7843;o m&#7853;t tr&#432;&#7899;c khi s&#7917;  d&#7909;ng trang web ho&#7863;c g&#7917;i b&#7845;t k&#7923; th&ocirc;ng tin c&aacute; nh&acirc;n n&agrave;o.</p>
<p align="left">Khi s&#7917;  d&#7909;ng trang web, b&#7841;n &#273;ang ch&#7845;p nh&#7853;n nh&#7919;ng &#273;i&#7873;u &#273;&#432;&#7907;c  m&ocirc; t&#7843; trong ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch b&#7843;o m&#7853;t. Nh&#7919;ng &#273;i&#7873;u n&agrave;y c&oacute; th&#7875;  thay &#273;&#7893;i, nh&#432;ng b&#7845;t k&#7923; thay &#273;&#7893;i n&agrave;o c&#361;ng &#273;&#7873;u s&#7869;&nbsp;&#273;&#432;&#7907;c  &#273;&#259;ng l&ecirc;n v&agrave; thay &#273;&#7893;i s&#7869; ch&#7881; &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho c&aacute;c ho&#7841;t  &#273;&#7897;ng v&agrave; th&ocirc;ng tin tr&ecirc;n c&#417; s&#7903; t&#7883;nh ti&#7871;n, ch&#7913; kh&ocirc;ng  ph&#7843;i h&#7891;i t&#7889;. B&#7841;n n&ecirc;n xem l&#7841;i ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch b&#7843;o m&#7853;t b&#7845;t  c&#7913; khi n&agrave;o b&#7841;n truy c&#7853;p trang web &#273;&#7875; &#273;&#7843;m b&#7843;o r&#7857;ng  m&igrave;nh hi&#7875;u c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin c&aacute; nh&acirc;n m&agrave; b&#7841;n cung c&#7845;p s&#7869; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c  s&#7917; d&#7909;ng nh&#432; th&#7871; n&agrave;o. Ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i l&agrave; gi&#7919;  k&iacute;n th&ocirc;ng tin c&aacute; nh&acirc;n nh&#7853;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c t&#7915; trang web ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n  b&iacute; m&#7853;t v&agrave; ch&#7881; d&ugrave;ng cho m&#7909;c &#273;&iacute;ch n&#7897;i b&#7897;. Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s&#7869;  kh&ocirc;ng chia s&#7867; th&ocirc;ng tin c&aacute; nh&acirc;n c&#7911;a b&#7841;n v&#7899;i b&#7845;t k&#7923;  b&ecirc;n n&agrave;o kh&aacute;c. H&atilde;y y&ecirc;n t&acirc;m r&#7857;ng ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i t&ocirc;n tr&#7885;ng s&#7921;  ri&ecirc;ng t&#432; c&#7911;a b&#7841;n v&agrave; x&#7917; l&yacute; d&#7919; li&#7879;u c&aacute; nh&acirc;n c&#7911;a b&#7841;n  v&#7899;i s&#7921; c&#7849;n tr&#7885;ng t&#7889;i &#273;a.</p>
<p align="left"><strong>THU  TH&#7852;P TH&Ocirc;NG TIN C&Aacute; NH&Acirc;N C&#7910;A B&#7840;N</strong></p>
<p align="left">Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i  thu th&#7853;p c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin &#273;&#7883;nh danh c&aacute; nh&acirc;n nh&#432; t&ecirc;n, &#273;&#7883;a  ch&#7881; b&#432;u &#273;i&#7879;n, &#273;&#7883;a ch&#7881; email, s&#7889; &#273;i&#7879;n tho&#7841;i, v.v&hellip;  khi kh&aacute;ch truy c&#7853;p t&#7921; nguy&#7879;n g&#7917;i cho ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i. Th&ocirc;ng tin  n&agrave;y ch&#7881; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#273;&#7875; &#273;&aacute;p &#7913;ng y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u c&#7909; th&#7875;  c&#7911;a b&#7841;n, tr&#7915; khi b&#7841;n cho ph&eacute;p s&#7917; d&#7909;ng n&oacute; theo c&aacute;ch  kh&aacute;c, v&iacute; d&#7909; th&ecirc;m b&#7841;n v&agrave;o danh s&aacute;ch g&#7917;i email c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng  t&ocirc;i. Th&ocirc;ng tin ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i thu th&#7853;p c&oacute; th&#7875; bao g&#7891;m t&ecirc;n,  ch&#7913;c danh, t&ecirc;n c&ocirc;ng ty hay t&#7893; ch&#7913;c, e-mail, &#273;i&#7879;n tho&#7841;i  v&agrave; ng&agrave;y sinh nh&#7853;t c&#7911;a b&#7841;n. Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c&oacute; th&#7875; thu th&#7853;p  m&#7897;t s&#7889; th&ocirc;ng tin nh&#7845;t &#273;&#7883;nh v&#7873; chuy&#7871;n th&#259;m c&#7911;a b&#7841;n,  ch&#7859;ng h&#7841;n nh&#432; lo&#7841;i tr&igrave;nh duy&#7879;t b&#7841;n s&#7917; d&#7909;ng; ng&agrave;y v&agrave;  th&#7901;i gian b&#7841;n truy c&#7853;p v&agrave;o trang web; c&aacute;c trang b&#7841;n truy  c&#7853;p khi m&#7903; trang web v&agrave; &#273;&#7883;a ch&#7881; trang web m&agrave; t&#7915; &#273;&oacute; b&#7841;n  k&#7871;t n&#7889;i tr&#7921;c ti&#7871;p &#273;&#7871;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i. Th&ocirc;ng  tin n&agrave;y &#273;&#432;&#7907;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#273;&#7875; gi&uacute;p c&#7843;i thi&#7879;n v&agrave; qu&#7843;n l&yacute;  trang web.</p>
<p align="left"><strong>COOKIE  / C&Ocirc;NG NGH&#7878; THEO D&Otilde;I</strong></p>
<p align="left">Trang web  c&oacute; th&#7875; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng cookie v&agrave; c&ocirc;ng ngh&#7879; theo d&otilde;i t&ugrave;y thu&#7897;c  v&agrave;o c&aacute;c t&iacute;nh n&#259;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c cung c&#7845;p. Cookie v&agrave; c&ocirc;ng ngh&#7879;  theo d&otilde;i r&#7845;t h&#7919;u &iacute;ch cho vi&#7879;c thu th&#7853;p th&ocirc;ng tin nh&#432; lo&#7841;i  tr&igrave;nh duy&#7879;t v&agrave; h&#7879; &#273;i&#7873;u h&agrave;nh, theo d&otilde;i s&#7889; l&#432;&#7907;ng kh&aacute;ch  truy c&#7853;p v&agrave;o trang web, v&agrave; hi&#7875;u bi&#7871;t kh&aacute;ch truy c&#7853;p s&#7917;  d&#7909;ng trang web nh&#432; th&#7871; n&agrave;o. Cookie c&#361;ng c&oacute; th&#7875; gi&uacute;p t&ugrave;y  ch&#7881;nh trang web cho kh&aacute;ch. Kh&ocirc;ng th&#7875; thu th&#7853;p &#273;&#432;&#7907;c th&ocirc;ng  tin c&aacute; nh&acirc;n th&ocirc;ng qua cookie v&agrave; c&ocirc;ng ngh&#7879; theo d&otilde;i kh&aacute;c, tuy  nhi&ecirc;n, n&#7871;u tr&#432;&#7899;c &#273;&oacute; b&#7841;n &#273;&atilde; cung c&#7845;p th&ocirc;ng tin c&aacute; nh&acirc;n  &#273;&#7883;nh danh, cookie c&oacute; th&#7875; g&#7855;n v&#7899;i c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin &#273;&oacute;.  Cookie v&agrave; th&ocirc;ng tin theo d&otilde;i thu th&#7853;p &#273;&#432;&#7907;c c&oacute; th&#7875; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c  chia s&#7867; v&#7899;i b&ecirc;n th&#7913; ba. Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c&#361;ng s&#7917; d&#7909;ng m&atilde; t&aacute;i  ti&#7871;p th&#7883; &#273;&#259;ng nh&#7853;p khi kh&aacute;ch truy c&#7853;p xem c&aacute;c trang c&#7909;  th&#7875;, cho ph&eacute;p ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i &#273;&#432;a ra c&aacute;c qu&#7843;ng c&aacute;o m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u  trong t&#432;&#417;ng lai.</p>
<p align="left"><strong>PH&Acirc;N  PH&#7888;I TH&Ocirc;NG TIN</strong></p>
<p align="left">Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i  x&#7917; l&yacute; t&#7845;t c&#7843; d&#7919; li&#7879;u kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p v&#7899;i Ph&aacute;p  l&#7879;nh d&#7919; li&#7879;u c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (Ri&ecirc;ng t&#432;) &#7903; Vi&#7879;t Nam. Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i  s&#7869; kh&ocirc;ng bao gi&#7901; b&aacute;n, chia s&#7867; ho&#7863;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng b&#7845;t k&#7923;  th&ocirc;ng tin c&aacute; nh&acirc;n n&agrave;o b&#7841;n cung c&#7845;p cho ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i v&igrave; b&#7845;t  k&#7923; m&#7909;c &#273;&iacute;ch n&agrave;o kh&aacute;c h&#417;n l&agrave; trao &#273;&#7893;i v&#7899;i b&#7841;n v&#7873;  c&aacute;c s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m, vi&#7879;c &#273;&#7863;t ch&#7895; ho&#7863;c th&#432; m&#7901;i &#273;&#7871;n c&aacute;c  s&#7921; ki&#7879;n c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i. Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c&oacute; th&#7875; chia s&#7867; th&ocirc;ng  tin v&#7899;i c&aacute;c c&#417; quan ch&iacute;nh ph&#7911; ho&#7863;c c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty kh&aacute;c h&#7895;  tr&#7907; ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i trong vi&#7879;c ph&ograve;ng ch&#7889;ng gian l&#7853;n ho&#7863;c &#273;i&#7873;u  tra.</p>
<p align="left"><strong>Ch&uacute;ng  t&ocirc;i c&oacute; th&#7875; l&agrave;m nh&#432; v&#7853;y khi:</strong> (1) &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ph&aacute;p lu&#7853;t  cho ph&eacute;p ho&#7863;c theo y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u c&#7911;a ph&aacute;p lu&#7853;t; (2) c&#7889; g&#7855;ng  &#273;&#7875; b&#7843;o v&#7879; ho&#7863;c ng&#259;n ch&#7863;n gian l&#7853;n th&#7921;c t&#7871; ho&#7863;c  ti&#7873;m n&#259;ng ho&#7863;c giao d&#7883;ch tr&aacute;i ph&eacute;p; (3) &#273;i&#7873;u tra gian l&#7853;n  &#273;&oacute; &#273;&atilde; x&#7843;y ra. C&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c cung c&#7845;p cho  c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty n&agrave;y v&igrave; m&#7909;c &#273;&iacute;ch ti&#7871;p th&#7883;.</p>
<p align="left">Th&ocirc;ng tin  c&aacute; nh&acirc;n c&#7911;a b&#7841;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c l&#432;u gi&#7919; an to&agrave;n. Ch&#7881; c&aacute;c nh&acirc;n  vi&ecirc;n, c&aacute;c &#273;&#7841;i l&yacute; v&agrave; nh&agrave; th&#7847;u &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#7911;y quy&#7873;n (ng&#432;&#7901;i  &#273;&atilde; &#273;&#7891;ng &yacute; gi&#7919; th&ocirc;ng tin an to&agrave;n v&agrave; b&#7843;o m&#7853;t) c&oacute; quy&#7873;n  ti&#7871;p c&#7853;n c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin n&agrave;y. T&#7845;t c&#7843; email v&agrave; b&#7843;n tin t&#7915;  trang web n&agrave;y cho ph&eacute;p b&#7841;n ch&#7885;n kh&ocirc;ng ti&#7871;p t&#7909;c nh&#7853;n th&#432;.</p>
<p align="left"><strong>C&Acirc;U  H&#7886;I</strong></p>
<p align="left">N&#7871;u b&#7841;n  c&oacute; b&#7845;t k&#7923; c&acirc;u h&#7887;i, m&#7889;i quan t&acirc;m, ho&#7863;c &yacute; ki&#7871;n g&igrave; v&#7873;  ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch b&#7843;o m&#7853;t c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i, xin vui l&ograve;ng li&ecirc;n h&#7879;  v&#7899;i ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i qua form Li&ecirc;n h&#7879; (<u><a href="https://vftfarms.com/contact">https://vftfarms.com/contact</a></u>)  v&#7899;i ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i.</p>
<p align="left">Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i  gi&#7919; quy&#7873;n th&#7921;c hi&#7879;n c&aacute;c thay &#273;&#7893;i trong ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch n&agrave;y.  T&#7845;t c&#7843; thay &#273;&#7893;i s&#7869; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ph&#7843;n &aacute;nh tr&ecirc;n trang web n&agrave;y.</p>
<p align="left"><strong>TH&#7900;I  GIAN &Aacute;P D&#7908;NG</strong></p>
<p align="left">Ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch  n&agrave;y &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &aacute;p d&#7909;ng xuy&ecirc;n su&#7889;t th&#7901;i gian trang web n&agrave;y  ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng.</p>


